.TH WEACTTERM 1 "October 2026" "0.6.0~stage6.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
weactterm \- PTY text terminal for WeAct FS35 USB displays
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B weactterm
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs a shell or command in a PTY using libvterm and FreeType.
Defaults to a finite memory-only demonstration. Display access requires
.BR --run .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Show usage.
.TP
.B --dry-run
Run without opening a display (default).
.TP
.B --run
Explicitly initialize and clear the physical FS35, then run the terminal.
.TP
.BI --device " PATH"
Select a specific matching CDC ACM device or udev alias.
.TP
.BI --serial " SERIAL"
Require this serial number. Multiple matches are rejected.
.TP
.B --allow-unknown-occupancy
Allow only foreign-process permission failures in occupancy scanning.
.TP
.BI --command " COMMAND"
Run /bin/sh -c COMMAND instead of the interactive shell.
.TP
.BI --font-size " tiny|small|normal|large|xlarge"
Choose startup cell size. Default normal is 60 by 20; tiny is 96 by 32.
.TP
.B --ctrl-c-to-pty
Forward Ctrl+C instead of exiting. Ctrl+] always exits.
.TP
.B --perf-stats
Print host performance statistics to stderr on exit, not LCD latency.
.TP
.BI --compression " off|fastlz"
Default off uses the existing Bitmap 05 path. Opt-in fastlz uses command15.
FastLZ was user-tested on FS35 firmware V1.0.0.1; select it explicitly.
There is no fallback after TX failure. Other firmware is not qualified.
.TP
.BI --brightness " 0..50"
Set backlight in percent after successful init. Omission leaves it unchanged.
.TP
.BI --brightness-fade-ms " 0..65535"
Requires brightness. Default1000ms; effective duration capped at5000ms.
.SH FILES
.I /usr/share/fonts/truetype/dejavu/DejaVuSansMono.ttf
.br
.I /dev/weact-fs35/by-path/
.SH LIMITATIONS
Only FS35 orientation 2, 480 by 320, RGB565 little-endian. No automatic
reconnect, daemon, full Unicode shaping or runtime font resizing.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sh (1),
.BR udev (7)
